            "review_title": "Review at Nam Bo Grilled Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Saman T\nCairns, Australia27 contributions\n0\nTypical local meeting place restaurant\nMar 2018 • Friends\nThis is your down to earth vibrant, no frills restaurant.\nAlways full with local groups celebrating something or other.\nThe food is to die for, the taste, colour, quantity is amazing.\nExpect the locals enjoying themselves very loudly.\nThey have this box next to each table, full of beer and soft cans and a bucket of ice, and a waiter who tops you up all the time. You can get fully tanked for $10 bucks if you don’t watch out.\nNeed a local friend to explain the menu\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 31, 2018",
